  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Shi Ge tells Mu Ling Lan that his son Zheng Yi has recently passed his ascension tribulation and become a Gu Immortal, but still lacks experience, so Shi Ge brings him along on the Heavenly Court ordered Northern Plains journey. The young lad greets them politely as Shi Ge’s son, Shi Zheng Yi. He asks whether Heavenly Lotus Sect has a fourth Immortal Gu House beyond Canary Pavilion, Yue Yang Palace, and Heavenly Pool.",
      "chapters": [
        1233
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shi_ge",
        "char_mu_ling_lan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_canary_pavilion",
        "house_yue_yang_palace",
        "loc_heavenly_pool"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Zhao Lian Yun sees him as a person with thick eyebrows and large eyes who is somewhat lacking in brains.",
      "chapters": [
        1255
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhao_lian_yun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On Snowy Mountain’s twelfth peak, he fights beside Zhao Lian Yun against Zhao Da Niu. He opens his mouth, flicks his tongue like a mechanical spring, and shoots crimson sword light from the tip. He names sword tongue Gu as his vital Immortal Gu and says he cultivates information path, not sword path. By continuing to speak he can heal injuries, and the louder he shouts the more powerful his attack becomes.",
      "chapters": [
        1255
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fights-zhao-da-niu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_snowy_mountain",
        "gu_sword_tongue_gu",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Zhao Lian Yun’s love Immortal Gu bathes them both in blue light; Shi Zheng Yi’s injuries disappear and his condition reaches an unprecedented peak. He then uses his immortal killer move Fist of Justice, and a giant fist of light rises from his body and strikes Zhao Da Niu, breaking through his defensive methods and opening a bloody hole in his chest. Zhao Da Niu falls and stops moving, and his body, soul, and immortal aperture are then absorbed as pure energy by the fate reversing sacrificial refinement formation.",
      "chapters": [
        1256
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fist-of-justice",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Watching Fang Yuan in Reverse Flow River, Shi Zheng Yi points out that he has stopped advancing and stands fixed in place, with the river no longer carrying him away.",
      "chapters": [
        1286
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "watching-fang-yuan-in-the-river",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_reverse_flow_river"
      ]
    }
  ],
